  "contentHtml": "<p>문제 상황 :</p><p>맛있는 얼음 음료를 받았는데, 오후에 먹으려고 하니 얼음이 다 녹아서 맛이 싱거워졌어요.&#160;</p><p>그래서 냉동실에 얼려서 다시 먹으려구요~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>(탐구)&#160;설탕물을&#160;얼렸다&#160;절반만&#160;녹이면&#160;용액이&#160;더&#160;달까?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7782677f79957d107c6a92824cfd461a4a70b86f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7782677f79957d107c6a92824cfd461a4a70b86f\" data-origin-width=\"729\" data-origin-height=\"489\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e8c43e60fe9290c69fca6b45d24a73be81c893b6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e8c43e60fe9290c69fca6b45d24a73be81c893b6\" data-origin-width=\"721\" data-origin-height=\"251\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
